1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,970
Tap Start recording in the visible app.

2
00:00:05,970 --> 00:00:10,230
The ongoing notification shows Stop and Panel.

3
00:00:10,230 --> 00:00:15,920
The display is off. The recording continues.

4
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:18,130
Wake the device and use lock screen controls.

5
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:21,290
Tap Stop and save.

6
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:27,834
Open and play the saved video on-device.
